From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:28:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] sunxi: ga36: pick init from the AXP boot source

A charger plug-in power-on sets the boot source bit (AXP_POWER_STATUS
bit 0), which stays clear on a power-key start and after a reboot.
Set ga36_init to the GA36 charge screen in that case and to /sbin/init
otherwise; the board's extlinux.conf passes it as init=.

Signed-off-by: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
---
 board/sunxi/board.c | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/board/sunxi/board.c b/board/sunxi/board.c
index b659e531..2c0f7db8 100644
--- a/board/sunxi/board.c
+++ b/board/sunxi/board.c
@@ -864,6 +864,17 @@ int misc_init_r(void)
 
 	setup_environment(gd->fdt_blob);
 
+#ifdef CONFIG_AXP221_POWER
+	/* GA36: a charger plug-in power-on runs the charge screen (extlinux append init=${ga36_init}). */
+	{
+		u8 status;
+
+		env_set("ga36_init", "/sbin/init");
+		if (!pmic_bus_read(AXP_POWER_STATUS, &status) && (status & AXP_POWER_STATUS_ALDO_IN))
+			env_set("ga36_init", "/usr/local/sbin/ga36-charge");
+	}
+#endif
+
 	return 0;
 }
 
